{"type": "CompositeElement", "element_id": "c4516e4513588cc60b664d898ce6d1ae", "text": "IssueID_IssueKey:18888 MAP-596\n\nProjectID_Key:MAP Mapper\n\nIssueType:Story\n\nStatus:Selected for Development\n\nPriority:{'self': 'https://nexefy.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/2', 'iconUrl': 'https://nexefy.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/high.svg', 'name': 'High', 'id': '2'}\n\nAssigneeID_Name:{} {}\n\nReporterAdr_Name:james@nexefy.com James\n\nLabels:\n\nComponents:\n\nAs a user I want to work across multiple frameworks\n\nA user may have multiple frameworks they want to work with.\n\nThere are two types of frameworks. Industry frameworks that we create, and custom frameworks that users create.\n\nThis card covers the experience of how users navigate between and work with multiple frameworks. How we create the frameworks if covered elsewhere.", "metadata": {"data_source": {"record_locator": {"id": "18888", "key": "MAP-596", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": "2025-03-28T01:45:21.634+0000", "date_modified": "2025-03-28T01:45:22.213+0000", "date_processed": "1744461415.3852818"}, "filename": "18888.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "languages": ["eng"], "orig_elements": ""}}